 ambox ambox-notice\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div class=\"mbox-image-div\"><span class=\"skin-invert\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg/60px-Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg/120px-Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></span></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">此條目<b>可參照<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tissue_(biology)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Tissue (biology)\">英語維基百科</a>相應條目來擴充</b>。<span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span> <small class=\"date-container\"><i>(<span class=\"date\">2020年10月1日</span>)</i></small><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"><br /><small>若您熟悉來源語言和主題，請協助<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%88%E5%88%99\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wikipedia:翻譯守則\">參考外語維基百科擴充條目</a>。請勿直接提交機械翻譯，也不要翻譯不可靠、低品質內容。依<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%9C%A8%E7%BB%B4%E5%9F%BA%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91%E5%86%85%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9\" title=\"Wikipedia:在維基百科內複製內容\">版權協議</a>，譯文需<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81#翻譯文章\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wikipedia:編輯摘要\">在編輯摘要註明來源</a>，或於討論頁頂部標記<code>{{<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Translated_page\" title=\"Template:Translated page\">Translated page</a>}}</code>標籤。</small></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"unihan-notice\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173172\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-size:small}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:2em;margin-bottom:0.8em;margin-top:0.8em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small{display:none}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\"><b>注意</b>：本頁有<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E7%B5%B1%E4%B8%80%E8%A1%A8%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97\" title=\"中日韓統一表意文字\">Unihan</a>新版漢字：「<span><span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"font-family: sans-serif, &#39;FZSongS-Extended&#39;, &#39;FZSongS-Extended(SIP)&#39;, &#39;WenQuanYi Zen Hei Mono&#39;, &#39;BabelStone Han&#39;, &#39;HanaMinB&#39;, &#39;I.MingCP&#39;, &#39;I.Ming&#39;, &#39;FZSong-Extended&#39;, &#39;Arial Unicode MS&#39;, Code2002, DFSongStd, &#39;STHeiti SC&#39;, unifont, SimSun-ExtG, SimSun-ExtB, TH-Tshyn-P0, TH-Tshyn-P1, TH-Tshyn-P2, Jigmo3, Jigmo2, Jigmo, ZhongHuaSongPlane15, ZhongHuaSongPlane02, ZhongHuaSongPlane00, LastResort;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=2AC63\">&#x2ac63;</a></span></span>」，這些字元可能會<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%82%E7%A2%BC\" title=\"亂碼\">錯誤顯示</a>，詳見<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:Unicode%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%E6%B1%89%E5%AD%97\" title=\"Wikipedia:Unicode擴展漢字\">Unicode擴充漢字</a>。</div></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Superficial_hair_follicle_tissue.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Superficial_hair_follicle_tissue.jpg/250px-Superficial_hair_follicle_tissue.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"109\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Superficial_hair_follicle_tissue.jpg/500px-Superficial_hair_follicle_tissue.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1283\" data-file-height=\"559\" /></a><figcaption>淺表<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AF%9B%E5%9B%8A\" title=\"毛囊\">毛囊</a>組織。</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>組織</b>（英語：<span lang=\"en\">Tissue</span>）舊稱<b>𪱣</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>，是生物學中介於<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%86%E8%83%9E\" title=\"細胞\">細胞</a>和完整<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%99%A8%E5%AE%98\" title=\"器官\">器官</a>之間的<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"生物组构层级\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Biological organisation\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E7%BB%84%E6%9E%84%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"生物組構層級（頁面不存在）\">生物組構層級</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Biological_organisation\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Biological organisation\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Biological organisation</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>，它由許多屬於同一器官的形態相似的細胞以及<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%86%E8%83%9E%E5%A4%96%E5%9F%BA%E8%B4%A8\" title=\"細胞外基質\">細胞外基質</a>組成，並且具有一定功能。不同的組織分工合作形成器官。研究組織的學科是<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%AD%A6\" title=\"組織學\">組織學</a>，研究其病態的學科是<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"組織病理學\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Histopathology\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%B5%84%E7%B9%94%E7%97%85%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"組織病理學（頁面不存在）\">組織病理學</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Histopathology\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Histopathology\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Histopathology</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>。多種組織構成一個器官。\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"动物组织\"><span id=\".E5.8A.A8.E7.89.A9.E7.BB.84.E7.BB.87\"></span>動物組織</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87_(%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：動物組織\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Emphysema_H_and_E.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Emphysema_H_and_E.jpg/250px-Emphysema_H_and_E.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"186\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Emphysema_H_and_E.jpg/500px-Emphysema_H_and_E.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"528\" data-file-height=\"393\" /></a><figcaption>人類肺部組織標本可見許多組織</figcaption></figure>\n<p>動物的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%97%E7%B2%BE%E5%8D%B5\" title=\"受精卵\">受精卵</a>經過細胞<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%86%E8%A3%82_(%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6)\" title=\"分裂 (生物學)\">分裂</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%86%E8%83%9E%E5%88%86%E5%8C%96\" title=\"細胞分化\">分化</a>，形成了<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%AE%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"上皮組織\">上皮組織</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%82%8C%E8%82%89%E7%B5%84%E7%B9%94\" title=\"肌肉組織\">肌肉組織</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9E%E7%B6%93%E7%B5%84%E7%B9%94\" title=\"神經組織\">神經組織</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%93%E7%BC%94%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87\" title=\"結締組織\">結締組織</a>等基本組織<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-:0&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-:0-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"植物组织\"><span id=\".E6.A4.8D.E7.89.A9.E7.BB.84.E7.BB.87\"></span>植物組織</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87_(%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：植物組織\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Stem-histology-cross-section-tag.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Stem-histology-cross-section-tag.svg/250px-Stem-histology-cross-section-tag.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"211\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Stem-histology-cross-section-tag.svg/500px-Stem-histology-cross-section-tag.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1222\" data-file-height=\"1030\" /></a><figcaption><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%9A%E9%BA%BB\" title=\"亞麻\">亞麻</a>莖的橫截面顯示多層不同組織類型</figcaption></figure>\n<p>植物組織包括<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%86%E7%94%9F%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87\" title=\"分生組織\">分生組織</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87_(%E6%A4%8D%E7%89%A9)\" title=\"基本組織 (植物)\">基本組織</a>等。分生組織經過分裂、分化形成<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"保護組織（頁面不存在）\">保護組織</a>、<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9C%BA%E6%A2%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"機械組織（頁面不存在）\">機械組織</a>、<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%90%A5%E5%85%BB%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"營養組織（頁面不存在）\">營養組織</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BE%93%E5%AF%BC%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87\" title=\"輸導組織\">輸導組織</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-:0&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-:0-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"参考文献\"><span id=\".E5.8F.82.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8C.AE\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87_(%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173179\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inheri